  "javaNotes": "Root at PartPose.offset(0,-15,0) (0.28 unit higher than today), turn and pulse on the PoseStack. Per frame group.yRot = (spin-1)*turn + idle: clouds, bolts, rain, sparks 0; eye and eyeArms -turn + radians((50*t) % 360); windRing (spin -1) -2*turn + radians((-28*t) % 360). Bob: rainNear y = 2.0 + 0.8*sin(2*pi*t/0.7), rainFar y = 2.4 + 0.8*sin(2*pi*t/0.55) - the drops dip into the cloud bottom and come out again, which reads as falling rain. Clouds are 8 overlapping groups at different phases, radii and heights (dark base, mid puffs, light tops, 4 high puffs for an uneven top, under-puffs); no two of them share a plane. Bolts: 4 instance parts at 45 + i*90 deg with xRot +18 (the lower end leans outward); 6 cubes as a blocky zigzag; their tips reach local +8.4 at radius 13.3, beside the head at eye level but 5 units outside the shoulders. Eye arms are yRot 35 slabs around the core (pinwheel). Glow pass: bolts, sparks, eye (24+8+1 = 33 of 133 boxes). Reach 15.9 (bolt tips), top 0.77 block above the head.",
  "animationNotesRu": "С каждым этапом тучи с молниями поворачиваются на 45 градусов. Капли дождя всё время падают из туч, ветер внутри кольца кружит в обратную сторону, а глаз бури вращается сам по себе и не замечает щелчков. При адаптации к боссу гроза закручивается без остановки."
